@startuml
left to right direction
actor Student
actor Teacher
rectangle ClearQuestion {
 usecase "Submit a question" as Submit
 usecase "Read public queue" as Read
 usecase "Vote" as Vote
 usecase "Inspect author" as Inspect
 usecase "Answer / hide / reopen" as Moderate
}
Student --> Submit
Student --> Read
Student --> Vote
Teacher --> Inspect
Teacher --> Moderate
@enduml
